  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/#portofolio\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>ZeroCloud</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>ZeroCloud — Privacy-First Image Suite</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview:</b> ZeroCloud is a high-performance, browser-based image utility designed for users who prioritize privacy. It allows for bulk image compression and optimization without ever sending a single byte of data to a server, keeping sensitive visual assets strictly local.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem):</b> Most online image compressors require users to upload their files to a remote server. This poses a significant security risk for sensitive documents or private photos. Additionally, server-side processing often introduces latency and dependency on internet stability.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Engineering &amp; Privacy):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Web Workers Integration:</b> Offloaded heavy image processing tasks to <b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">Web Workers</b>. This ensures the main UI thread remains responsive (no freezing) even when compressing multiple high-resolution images simultaneously.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Client-Side Processing:</b> Leveraged browser APIs to handle all computations locally. The \"Zero\" in ZeroCloud stands for <b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"118\">Zero Server Interaction</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Reactive Flow:</b> Built with <b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"26\">Nuxt 3</b>, utilizing its reactive state management to provide real-time feedback on compression ratios and file size savings.</p></li></ul><p> </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Link</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://zerocloud-compress.vercel.app/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"4\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3MCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzQtMS5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/4-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/4-1.png\" alt=\"4\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"5\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzUtMy5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/5-3.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/5-3.png\" alt=\"5\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"6\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzYtMi5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/6-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/6-2.png\" alt=\"6\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"7\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3MywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzctMi5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/7-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/7-2.png\" alt=\"7\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result:</b> A professional-grade utility that bridges the gap between powerful image editing and absolute data sovereignty</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2> <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Tech Stack</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    Nuxt 3\n    Web Workers\n    Client-side API\n    Tailwind CSS\n<style>\n.kh-stack-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 15px 0; }\n.kh-badge { padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; transition: all 0.3s ease; }\n.kh-badge:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }\n/* ZeroCloud Colors */\n.nuxt { background-color: #ECFDF5; color: #059669; border: 1px solid #A7F3D0; }\n.workers { background-color: #FFF7ED; color: #C2410C; border: 1px solid #FFEDD5; }\n.logic { background-color: #F0F9FF; color: #0369A1; border: 1px solid #BAE6FD; }\n.tailwind { background-color: #F5F3FF; color: #7C3AED; border: 1px solid #DDD6FE; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    🛡️ Privacy-First\n    ⚡ Edge Computing\n    🖼️ Image Optimization\n    📦 Local Utility\n<style>\n.topic-container-horizontal {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n}\n.topic-pill-v2 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); /* Sedikit transparan */\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #ffffff; /* Teks Putih */\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.topic-icon {\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n}\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n            Multi-threading (Web Workers)\n            100%\n            Client-side Logic\n            100%\n            Nuxt 3 Architecture\n            100%\n<style>\n.skills-used-container {\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n.skill-item {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.skill-info {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #ffffff; /* WARNA TEKS PUTIH */\n}\n.progress-bar-v2 {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 6px;\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n.progress-fill-v2 {\n    height: 100%;\n    background-color: #50FFD9; /* WARNA BAR KONSISTEN */\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(80, 255, 217, 0.4);\n    transition: width 1.5s ease-in-out;\n}\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">On-Device Compression:</b> Files never leave your browser, ensuring 100% data privacy.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-threaded Engine:</b> Faster processing using Web Workers to avoid UI lag.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bulk Processing:</b> Optimize multiple images at once with smart queue management.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Instant Preview:</b> Compare original vs compressed quality in real-time.</p></li></ul>"
}